units metal
atom_style atomic
atom_modify map array
boundary p p p
region cell block 0 30 0 30 0 30 units box
create_box 1 cell
create_atoms 1 single 10 10 10 units box
create_atoms 1 single 11 10 10 units box
create_atoms 1 single 10.3 10.8 10 units box
mass 1 10
fix mol all property/atom mol ghost yes
set group all mol 1
pair_style zero 10
pair_coeff * *
comm_modify cutoff 10
velocity all set 0 0 0
fix rb all rigid/npt/small molecule temp 300 300 1 iso 10000 10000 1
timestep 0.001
thermo 1
thermo_style custom step temp press vol lx ly lz
thermo_modify flush yes
dump state all custom 1 state.dump id mol x y z xs ys zs xu yu zu ix iy iz vx vy vz
dump_modify state sort id format float %.17g
run 1
